# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/
/gen/schemas

# Downloaded/copied sidecar binaries (ffmpeg ~100MB, yt-dlp ~17MB) — not
# source, exceed GitHub's file-size comfort zone, and are trivially
# reproducible (see the sidecar-bundling notes in tauri.conf.json's
# externalBin comment) rather than something to version.
/binaries/*.exe
